### 🧭 About me

I lead the technical direction of **PairProgramming**, a studio focused on scalable digital systems (LATAM + Europe). I don't ship isolated features: I design solid foundations so the product can grow.

My current focus is **agentic LLM systems, programmatic SEO and GEO optimization** — building products that live *inside the conversation with the AI*, not just in the search engine.

Before code, I spent nearly **15 years in healthcare, many of them in emergency response**. That's where I got my structured thinking and the calm to make decisions with incomplete information — exactly when the cost of getting it wrong is high.

---

### 🤖 AI & Agents

What I'm most into right now:

- 🧠 **Multi-agent LLM pipelines** — content generation and validation at scale (Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini, Groq, Mistral, Cohere)
- ⚙️ **Agent generator** — building custom agents on top of my own data and tools
- 🔌 **MCP servers** (Model Context Protocol) — connecting LLMs to my systems; PairProgramming exposes its own MCP at `/api/mcp`
- 🎯 **Multi-LLM RAG, structured outputs, prompt design and evals** as part of the development cycle
- 🔎 **GEO / AI search** — brand visibility in AI-generated answers (GSC, GA4, Profound)

> On **[miseguro.com.ar](https://miseguro.com.ar)**, **30% of traffic already comes from ChatGPT and other AI search engines** — with 5,000+ organic visits/month reached in 4 weeks.

